        "\\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{10}{30}，\\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{12}{30}，\\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5}{30}。",
        "10/30 + 12/30 + 5/30 = 27/30 = 9/10。",
